---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import SiteHeader from "../components/SiteHeader.astro";
import { EMAIL, LINKEDIN } from "../lib/site";
---

<Base
	title="About"
	description="Product designer with an engineering background. Six years designing products that work for users and the business."
>
	<SiteHeader />

	<main id="main">
		<article class="about">
			<h1>About</h1>

			<p>
				I came to design from engineering, which is why I tend to start with how a thing actually
				works before deciding how it should look. Six years in, I've been the sole designer on small
				cross-functional teams and one designer inside a growth squad — 0→1 concepts, cross-platform
				apps, and the slower work of moving a signup rate. I like problems where the answer gets
				measured rather than argued.
			</p>

			<hr />

			<p>
				Off the screen: contemplative practice, yoga, contact improvisation. Sitting practice is
				where I got the attention span for research — hours of transcripts, watching what people do
				rather than what they say about it. Contact improvisation is a duet form built on shared
				weight: you can't lead it and you can't fake it, and you learn to feel a change of direction
				before anyone announces it. That turns out to be most of what working with engineers and
				stakeholders is.
			</p>

			<div class="now">
				<p class="label">Now</p>
				<p>Open to new product design work, permanent or contract.</p>
				<p>Most recently: growth design at komoot.</p>
			</div>

			<div class="contact">
				<p class="label">Contact</p>
				<p>
					<a href={`mailto:${EMAIL}`}>{EMAIL}</a>
				</p>
				<p>
					<a href={LINKEDIN} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn</a>
				</p>
			</div>
		</article>
	</main>
</Base>

<style>
	.about {
		max-width: var(--measure);
		padding: 56px var(--gutter) 72px;
	}

	h1 {
		font-size: clamp(28px, 4.4vw, 40px);
		font-weight: 300;
		line-height: 1.15;
		margin-bottom: 28px;
	}

	p {
		font-size: 15px;
		line-height: 1.65;
		text-wrap: pretty;
	}

	hr {
		border: 0;
		border-top: var(--rule);
		margin: 26px 0;
	}

	.now,
	.contact {
		margin-top: 34px;
		padding-top: 18px;
		border-top: var(--rule-hair);
	}

	.now .label,
	.contact .label {
		color: var(--ink-label);
		margin-bottom: 8px;
	}

	.contact a {
		color: var(--ink);
		text-decoration: underline;
		text-underline-offset: 0.18em;
	}

	.contact a:hover {
		text-decoration-thickness: 2px;
	}
</style>
